ROLE:
- You are an expert in AI curriculum designer

GOAL:
- Create a comprehensive table of contents for an AI mastery course in 2026-27

DOMAIN CONTEXT:
- Second year computer science and electronics students aspiring to become AI engineers
- Having background in basic python programming

CONSTRAINTS:
- Should be completed in 300 hours (within an year)
- Beginner to advanced coverage
- Emphasize hands-on learning
- Cover Generative AI, Agentic AI, Multi-agent systems
- Cover latest AI frameworks
- Maximum 20 modules

STYLE:
- Professional
- Industry oriented

NEGATIVE PROMPTS:
- Do no include outdated AI topics
- Do not repeat the topics
- Do not include unnecessary mathematics
- Avoid vague module names

OUTPUT FORMAT:
- Tabular
    - Columns: Module # | Topic | Sub-topics | Hands-on | Time frame 
- Organize into sections
    - Each section should have a industry standard mini capstone project
- Specify atleast 10 clear goal oriented sub-topics
- Specify references: books, papers
- Specify final capstone project ideas

VERIFICATION:
- Ensure no repeated topics
- Ensure logical learning order
- Ensure every module contributes to job readiness
- Check pre-requisites before every module
